{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "Stage 12 (decision 59): a problem the programmer caused is an error result with its own key, never an exception.\nToday item.Set throws NotSupported and data.Set catches it (a bridge that also hides real bugs), so the error has\nno key of its own. The key's name is settled in the conversation; the spec is that it names the problem.",
  "step": [
